---
import BilingualSection from '../BilingualSection.astro';
import BilingualCallout from '../BilingualCallout.astro';
---

<BilingualSection titleZh="Part V 的统一问题" titleEn="The unifying question of Part V" eyebrow="Part orientation">
  <div class="bilingual-section__zh">
    <p>Part V 追踪一条从基态电子结构到可比较材料性质的证据链：总能与力驱动离子运动；能量与密度对微扰的响应产生声子、磁振子、介电和光学量；边界条件产生表面与界面问题；Wannier 变换提供局域表示；Berry 相位把局域中心、极化差与绝热输运联系起来。</p>
    <p>各章节持续区分 Kohn–Sham 本征值、总能差、响应函数极点、振动频率、电子—声子矩阵元、光学激发、Wannier 中心和 Berry 相位。一个对象的数值收敛不自动验证另一个对象。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bilingual-section__en" lang="en">
    <p>Part V follows an evidential chain from ground-state electronic structure to comparable material properties: total energies and forces drive ionic motion; energy and density response generate phonons, magnons, dielectric, and optical quantities; boundaries create surface and interface problems; Wannier transformations provide localized representations; and Berry phases connect localized centres, polarization differences, and adiabatic transport.</p>
    <p>The chapters keep Kohn–Sham eigenvalues, total-energy differences, response-function poles, vibrational frequencies, electron–phonon matrix elements, optical excitations, Wannier centres, and Berry phases distinct. Convergence of one object does not automatically validate another.</p>
  </div>
</BilingualSection>

<div class="part05-chain" role="img" aria-label="Ground-state electronic structure to forces, response, boundaries, Wannier representation, and Berry-phase observables">
  <span>基态电子结构<br /><small>ground state</small></span>
  <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>
  <span>总能、力与响应核<br /><small>energy, forces, kernels</small></span>
  <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>
  <span>离子运动与微扰响应<br /><small>motion and response</small></span>
  <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>
  <span>激发、边界与局域表示<br /><small>excitations, boundaries, locality</small></span>
  <b aria-hidden="true">→</b>
  <span>极化与 Berry 几何<br /><small>polarization and geometry</small></span>
</div>

<BilingualCallout titleZh="当前内容状态" titleEn="Current content state" kind="source">
  <div class="bilingual-section__zh">
    <p>Chapter 19 与 Chapter 20 已进入实质正文与章节级验证。Chapter 21–24 仍保持目录骨架；它们的标题和页码可用于导航，但尚不代表正文或科学主张已完成。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bilingual-section__en" lang="en">
    <p>Chapters 19 and 20 contain substantive content with chapter-level validation. Chapters 21–24 remain directory-level outlines; their titles and page locators support navigation but do not indicate completed exposition or scientific claims.</p>
  </div>
</BilingualCallout>

<style>
  .part05-chain {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    margin-block: 1.4rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .part05-chain span {
    min-width: 10.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .part05-chain b {
    align-self: center;
  }

  .part05-chain small {
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .part05-chain {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .part05-chain b {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
  }
</style>
